                <custos xml:id="m-ecaf7f5d-191b-4f0f-8f36-dcf0785e44ed" facs="#m-5ffc0c45-bb5a-437e-a061-987fe7d40620" pname="c" oct="3" />
                <divLine xml:id="m-1df16ee9-5e5c-4b97-a62c-4a2e399db4a3" facs="#m-230bce1f-a20e-4060-bd04-3c17a03f78d3" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-3d74b99c-8f6a-4186-95db-e0be708f685f">
              <lg xml:id="m-3011316f-25bf-48ca-9cbd-b00e496d8aea">
                <l xml:id="m-697f55e8-48bf-4758-81b9-3be08bcb12ad" facs="#m-c591bf45-6a47-4104-9356-be4786c2973e" label="ambiguous">740</l><l xml:id="m-63bbe1e9-239b-4c58-b80d-bdd089baaff5" facs="#m-4745fd25-9764-4171-a7c0-a1d2fae39133" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-54b9f561-f72a-4073-bbe2-4c4e8c69dbe6" facs="#m-b12507ac-a6d9-4944-92e5-6574244e926c" label="lyrics-like">Pópule méus.</l><l xml:id="m-1abbd5d0-3516-4a16-8ee2-0a3c723551c1" facs="#m-1828da2d-6ef8-454a-abf1-2172eff3af6a" label="lyrics-like">ce-a látus mé-um.</l><l xml:id="m-7928bf98-3eb6-4ea1-a7e6-14aa8f639847" facs="#m-044678c3-5143-4191-84b9-55943c50b404" label="text-like">Two cantors of the first choir sing:</l><l xml:id="m-1aa50e2c-4c9a-4c52-baec-5b370775d56d" facs="#m-ef66d01a-6b80-4e73-933e-8fe32371c010" label="lyrics-like">in colúmna nú-bis: et tu</l><l xml:id="m-abad97d6-5d82-4f0a-8aca-89b0423b0851" facs="#m-59e8bacc-4e24-445c-bcb8-c8315d113375" label="lyrics-like">4. Ego ante te prae-í-vi</l><l xml:id="m-fc389dad-824f-4ead-90ea-508d379447d1" facs="#m-b22c18b1-e49e-4103-9709-737d9af4bb59" label="lyrics-like">Pópule méus.</l><l xml:id="m-db2b8a78-edce-410d-a091-b99036350027" facs="#m-0016f9b3-aeb2-41f7-81f8-65e393841a2e" label="lyrics-like">me duxísti ad praetó-ri-um Pi-lá-ti.</l><l xml:id="m-60bd59d0-17f3-4cb3-8551-94bf895e555b" facs="#m-845b0f82-0ff2-4318-98d3-8a8eaaccc54e" label="text-like">Tuo cantors of the second choir sing:</l><l xml:id="m-3383f181-76e0-4570-a5ed-c00ef73be1e6" facs="#m-c8b683d0-4840-4048-a7b0-99cae94cc79b" label="lyrics-like">5. Ego te pávi mánna per desér-tum: et tu me ceci-dísti</l><l xml:id="m-7e0cf2a5-940e-40ec-b5dd-4a21061ea995" facs="#m-2b9793eb-de66-4a3d-a775-b6bcf7fed062" label="lyrics-like">á-lapis et flagéllis.</l><l xml:id="m-9598e3c0-ba94-4cc2-8594-83ea16efd5e9" facs="#m-8b109ebe-b5a0-4a31-9952-137fd584f044" label="lyrics-like">Pópule méus.</l><l xml:id="m-38cafb72-7f3f-469a-9fa9-b77f6799b193" facs="#m-6b0755ec-b069-4c11-8c81-a9aacb64cd36" label="text-like">Tuo cantors of the first choir sing:</l><l xml:id="m-be435674-becd-4aa2-90f1-1ea03cecf190" facs="#m-58c968e7-c0da-4ce7-bbee-956ee61e73a5" label="lyrics-like">6. Ego te po-távi áqua sa-lútis de pé-tra:</l><l xml:id="m-bcfc0837-270e-4427-8884-ab72972889ba" facs="#m-4a631e8d-6a97-4e5d-a875-8a4df34febfb" label="ambiguous">et tu me po¬</l><l xml:id="m-711b9e8b-9ae3-4505-9ec8-095e1f5b171c" facs="#m-190994ce-c241-41b4-b66c-eab81df2b2a1" label="lyrics-like">tásti félle et acé-to.</l><l xml:id="m-a305ac62-dfe9-4f68-955b-5274d13afde9" facs="#m-06da24c7-b52d-4718-b6e9-9208a8983c14" label="lyrics-like">Pópule méus.</l><l xml:id="m-e5c3f37b-4e84-4c4a-9c00-27d7bb825c4a" facs="#m-4b79c6fc-41e0-4e6b-994f-779bd629c7d2" label="text-like">Two cantors of the second choir sing:</l><l xml:id="m-6ab438e0-37cb-47c0-8219-747c39e3a389" facs="#m-71dce80e-f0a7-448d-9eb7-b816ed0dade3" label="lyrics-like">7. Ego propter te Chananacórum réges percús-si:</l><l xml:id="m-934f9252-c399-496a-8284-83e0d57c1f94" facs="#m-02c08fcc-7a97-48a8-b7a1-da444876e6fc" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-89165a58-9e6a-4e9e-918b-cf47e8e39a88" facs="#m-fba21812-2b32-4ffe-bb46-2ed27e203570" label="lyrics-like">Pópule méus</l><l xml:id="m-e435b09e-138a-47a1-9b7a-c9f917dbdd8b" facs="#m-d9ddc8f9-5f42-4104-bb04-0f3acba7a13d" label="lyrics-like">tu percussísti</l><l xml:id="m-6f5bdc04-5c48-4271-9639-5375ca5f6c11" facs="#m-b2928eea-baa7-45fe-a870-d4c4ca5301c4" label="lyrics-like">arúndine cáput mé- um.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>